				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>他の　プラズマ団も
必ず　探しだしすッ！▼
オレ……　ポケモンどろぼう　は
許さないッ！　絶対にッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T05:14:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
